 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.35,
   "e": 8.214,
   "text": "In nineteen forty-nine, a psychologist wrote one sentence about how brains learn.",
   "dur": 7.864,
   "voiced": 441,
   "sim": 0.89,
   "f0": 119.335,
   "st": -1.214,
   "range_st": 6.116,
   "asr": 0.828,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 9.477,
   "e": 17.84,
   "text": "Seventy-seven years later, that sentence is hiding inside every chatbot you have ever talked to.",
   "dur": 8.363,
   "voiced": 434,
   "sim": 0.896,
   "f0": 125.09,
   "st": -0.398,
   "range_st": 6.826,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 18.221,
   "e": 21.014,
   "text": "Just not where anyone expected it.",
   "dur": 2.792,
   "voiced": 144,
   "sim": 0.854,
   "f0": 130.962,
   "st": 0.396,
   "range_st": 6.082,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 21.774,
   "e": 29.818,
   "text": "To find it, we first have to understand why every attempt to build a brain-like AI has failed.",
   "dur": 8.044,
   "voiced": 435,
   "sim": 0.897,
   "f0": 126.797,
   "st": -0.163,
   "range_st": 8.025,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 31.171,
   "e": 33.788,
   "text": "Welcome to this technical masterclass.",
   "dur": 2.617,
   "voiced": 139,
   "sim": 0.825,
   "f0": 138.205,
   "st": 1.328,
   "range_st": 8.105,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 34.008,
   "e": 38.665,
   "text": "Look around at the current frontier of artificial intelligence:",
   "dur": 4.657,
   "voiced": 249,
   "sim": 0.829,
   "f0": 122.612,
   "st": -0.745,
   "range_st": 5.96,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 38.879,
   "e": 48.428,
   "text": "OpenAI's GPT-6 Astra, Anthropic's Claude 5.5, Google DeepMind's Gemini 4, and Mythos.",
   "dur": 9.549,
   "voiced": 498,
   "sim": 0.85,
   "f0": 129.03,
   "st": 0.139,
   "range_st": 8.823,
   "asr": 0.867,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 49.45,
   "e": 56.166,
   "text": "Across every benchmark in mathematical reasoning, software synthesis, and multi-turn dialogue,",
   "dur": 6.716,
   "voiced": 408,
   "sim": 0.878,
   "f0": 125.11,
   "st": -0.395,
   "range_st": 7.083,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 56.347,
   "e": 61.167,
   "text": "these systems exhibit remarkable cognitive capabilities.",
   "dur": 4.82,
   "voiced": 250,
   "sim": 0.834,
   "f0": 124.237,
   "st": -0.517,
   "range_st": 6.318,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 61.503,
   "e": 69.815,
   "text": "Yet behind the dazzling demonstrations lies a profound and unsettling architectural truth.",
   "dur": 8.312,
   "voiced": 425,
   "sim": 0.857,
   "f0": 119.595,
   "st": -1.176,
   "range_st": 5.42,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 70.992,
   "e": 79.28,
   "text": "Every single foundational model in production today is a frozen, static monolith of computation.",
   "dur": 8.288,
   "voiced": 488,
   "sim": 0.866,
   "f0": 128.782,
   "st": 0.105,
   "range_st": 7.029,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 80.306,
   "e": 85.036,
   "text": "Consider the computational lifecycle of a modern language model.",
   "dur": 4.73,
   "voiced": 306,
   "sim": 0.859,
   "f0": 122.113,
   "st": -0.815,
   "range_st": 8.848,
   "asr": 0.842,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 86.286,
   "e": 89.233,
   "text": "Over several months of pre-training,",
   "dur": 2.947,
   "voiced": 163,
   "sim": 0.787,
   "f0": 131.029,
   "st": 0.405,
   "range_st": 10.528,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 89.47,
   "e": 95.538,
   "text": "clusters of tens of thousands of GPUs consume millions of kilowatt hours",
   "dur": 6.068,
   "voiced": 361,
   "sim": 0.848,
   "f0": 130.302,
   "st": 0.309,
   "range_st": 9.433,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 95.791,
   "e": 102.059,
   "text": "to optimize hundreds of billions of numerical parameters across trillions of tokens.",
   "dur": 6.269,
   "voiced": 388,
   "sim": 0.844,
   "f0": 133.187,
   "st": 0.688,
   "range_st": 8.066,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 103.402,
   "e": 111.39,
   "text": "During this training epoch, the system learns by updating its numerical weights through stochastic gradient descent.",
   "dur": 7.988,
   "voiced": 402,
   "sim": 0.867,
   "f0": 124.872,
   "st": -0.428,
   "range_st": 7.896,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 112.269,
   "e": 116.025,
   "text": "But the exact instant that training completes,",
   "dur": 3.756,
   "voiced": 171,
   "sim": 0.869,
   "f0": 126.959,
   "st": -0.141,
   "range_st": 4.41,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 116.563,
   "e": 119.443,
   "text": "the learning process halts forever.",
   "dur": 2.88,
   "voiced": 144,
   "sim": 0.761,
   "f0": 128.113,
   "st": 0.015,
   "range_st": 6.514,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 120.379,
   "e": 126.024,
   "text": "The neural weights are etched into silicon like ancient stone monuments.",
   "dur": 5.645,
   "voiced": 311,
   "sim": 0.861,
   "f0": 124.946,
   "st": -0.418,
   "range_st": 6.988,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 126.696,
   "e": 135.747,
   "text": "When you query the model at inference time, whether you ask it to compose a simple haiku or prove a subtle theorem in algebraic geometry,",
   "dur": 9.051,
   "voiced": 559,
   "sim": 0.873,
   "f0": 134.721,
   "st": 0.886,
   "range_st": 9.035,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 135.895,
   "e": 138.49,
   "text": "not a single synapse moves.",
   "dur": 2.595,
   "voiced": 142,
   "sim": 0.812,
   "f0": 128.902,
   "st": 0.122,
   "range_st": 7.431,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 139.419,
   "e": 141.562,
   "text": "No new connections form.",
   "dur": 2.142,
   "voiced": 147,
   "sim": 0.747,
   "f0": 127.112,
   "st": -0.121,
   "range_st": 7.875,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "s": 141.75,
   "e": 144.659,
   "text": "No outdated pathways dissolve.",
   "dur": 2.909,
   "voiced": 177,
   "sim": 0.817,
   "f0": 121.305,
   "st": -0.93,
   "range_st": 7.725,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "s": 145.229,
   "e": 152.955,
   "text": "The network cannot dynamically reallocate its internal routing topology to adapt to the complexity of your request.",
   "dur": 7.727,
   "voiced": 491,
   "sim": 0.872,
   "f0": 128.693,
   "st": 0.093,
   "range_st": 7.243,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "s": 154.293,
   "e": 158.699,
   "text": "In our live terminal, examine the attention implementation.",
   "dur": 4.406,
   "voiced": 288,
   "sim": 0.852,
   "f0": 133.278,
   "st": 0.7,
   "range_st": 8.664,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "s": 159.068,
   "e": 171.449,
   "text": "The projection weights, W Q, W K, and W V, are loaded into GPU high-bandwidth memory as fixed FP16 tensors.",
   "dur": 12.382,
   "voiced": 672,
   "sim": 0.882,
   "f0": 122.762,
   "st": -0.723,
   "range_st": 6.997,
   "asr": 0.769,
   "attempts": 3,
   "level": 1,
   "weak": true
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "s": 171.849,
   "e": 180.289,
   "text": "Every single incoming token vector is multiplied against these identical, immutable arrays.",
   "dur": 8.44,
   "voiced": 484,
   "sim": 0.882,
   "f0": 132.744,
   "st": 0.63,
   "range_st": 7.657,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "s": 181.562,
   "e": 185.715,
   "text": "While activations change dynamically from token to token,",
   "dur": 4.152,
   "voiced": 262,
   "sim": 0.803,
   "f0": 128.638,
   "st": 0.086,
   "range_st": 6.39,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "s": 185.901,
   "e": 191.735,
   "text": "the underlying parametric landscape is completely rigid and invariant.",
   "dur": 5.834,
   "voiced": 337,
   "sim": 0.848,
   "f0": 121.761,
   "st": -0.865,
   "range_st": 7.618,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "s": 193.121,
   "e": 205.085,
   "text": "Why has the entire multi-billion dollar enterprise of artificial intelligence consolidated around this rigid, unyielding architectural paradigm?",
   "dur": 11.964,
   "voiced": 784,
   "sim": 0.861,
   "f0": 127.349,
   "st": -0.088,
   "range_st": 7.125,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "s": 205.785,
   "e": 216.486,
   "text": "In this investigation, we explore the deep mathematical, physical, and hardware forces that created the modern AI monolith...",
   "dur": 10.701,
   "voiced": 614,
   "sim": 0.905,
   "f0": 134.412,
   "st": 0.846,
   "range_st": 8.317,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "s": 216.838,
   "e": 228.549,
   "text": "and why the tantalizing dream of truly self-adapting intelligence has proven so fiercely difficult to realize in physical silicon.",
   "dur": 11.711,
   "voiced": 616,
   "sim": 0.906,
   "f0": 120.482,
